<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why This Approach</span>
      <h2 id="why-heading" class="section-heading">What Sets Fixed Implants Apart</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>They Don't Come Out</h3>
        <p>Unlike removable dentures, fixed implant prostheses stay in place. No adhesives, no slipping, no removing them at night.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Real Chewing Power</h3>
        <p>Implants anchor into bone, giving you a bite force closer to natural teeth than any conventional denture can provide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Bone Preservation</h3>
        <p>Implants stimulate the jawbone the way tooth roots do, slowing or stopping the bone loss that progresses after teeth are removed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Natural Appearance</h3>
        <p>Modern full-arch prostheses are designed to complement your facial structure and look completely natural.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="candidate-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Candidacy</span>
      <h2 id="candidate-heading" class="section-heading">Who Is This For?</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>Full-arch implant treatment is appropriate for patients who have lost most or all teeth in one or both arches, or whose remaining teeth cannot be saved and need to be removed. It is also a path for patients currently wearing complete dentures who want a fixed, stable alternative.</p>
      <p>Adequate bone volume is required to support implants. In cases where bone has been lost, <a href="/bone-grafting" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">bone grafting</a> or <a href="/zygomatic-implants" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">zygomatic implants</a> may extend candidacy. A consultation with {{ site.doctorName }} will determine whether — and how — this treatment can work for you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

